description = "Slams the target with your shield, dealing {hit} damage with {threat}x threat. Shatters all your Ice Layers into it: {slam_layer} Frost damage for each. If the target has your Rime Shell or was Frozen by you, that ice shatters on it alone too, for {flat1} bonus damage plus {shatter} Frost damage. These shatters do not hit nearby enemies."
